Kernel change for 0.2.20-q8.2: stage the Q8 reduce kernel's row maximum and
per-part softmax weights in threadgroup memory instead of recomputing them in
all 256 threads of the row. Bit-exact (verified: greedy continuation hash
unchanged) and +2.5% decode at a 112,881-token prompt.

